1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Rockstar hid things in GTA 6... that almost nobody has found.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:05,000
Ten crazy details you missed.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,400
Check your phone's ringtones. Wind Chimes is the exact tone Michael used in GTA 5.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:15,600
There's an apartment that looks straight out of Dexter... but Rockstar won't let you inside.

5
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:21,000
A parrot named Tony keeps yelling generator. Follow the clue and you'll find a hidden cash stash.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,400
Swim too far out, and a dog in goggles rides in on a jet ski to save you.

7
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:31,600
Stay on board long enough... and it takes you to an island full of dogs.

8
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:37,200
Climb a radio tower for seven minutes, throw an egg from the top, and a secret cutscene unlocks.

9
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:42,600
At a research facility, a giant mutant crab can ambush you. Yes, really.

10
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:48,400
In some bars, people whisper about a secret bunker full of jetpacks, hidden under a mountain.

11
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:54,200
And there's a strange monument near Manifest Canyon. Players are calling it the new Mount Chiliad mystery.

12
00:00:54,200 --> 00:01:02,600
But the craziest one? A building in GTA 6 was hidden in the San Andreas remaster years ago. Rockstar was teasing us the whole time.

13
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:08,000
Which one did you miss? Comment below, and send this to your squad.

